          "provenance": "knowledge_note"
        },
        {
          "type": "standard",
          "content_cn": "企业须识别并处理其自身运营、子公司运营以及活动链中的实际和潜在人权与环境不利影响。",
          "quote": {
            "text": "identify and address actual and potential adverse human rights and environmental impacts",
            "source": "欧盟委员会 CSDDD 专题页"
          },
          "provenance": "knowledge_note"
        }
